@startuml j8-payment-screenshot
!include c4-sequence.iuml
title J8 Payment screenshot and reading its amount
actor "Owner" as O <<person>>
box "Hisaab in the browser"
participant "Entry form\n(app.js)" as H <<container>>
database "Browser storage\n(localStorage)" as S <<store>>
end box
participant "Screenshot reader\n(from cdn.jsdelivr.net)" as R <<external>>
O -> H : under "Payment screenshot (optional)" press\n"Choose screenshot" and pick the picture
H -> H : switch to "You got (payment)"; shrink the picture\nto at most 600 px on its longest side
H --> O : "Reading the amount from the screenshot..."
H -> R : fetch the reader from cdn.jsdelivr.net, the first time
note right of R : the request for the reader leaves the device;\nthe picture does not: it is read in the browser
R --> H : the text found in the picture
alt an amount was found
  H --> O : "Read Rs {amt} from the screenshot. Check it before saving."
else nothing readable, or no internet
  H --> O : "Could not read an amount from this picture. Type it in."
end
note right of H : the amount read only fills the form;\nthe owner checks it and saves
O -> H : check "Amount (₹)", press "Save entry"
H -> S : save the entry with the small picture
H --> O : the picture shows on the entry
@enduml
